---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Witchly — Scaling a game-hosting ISP to 10,000 users | Tushar A."
  description="Case study: how Tushar scaled Witchly.host from zero to 10,000+ users on Hetzner bare-metal, solo, with no funding. Architecture, security, email deliverability, lessons."
  pageType="article"
>
  <Nav />

  <main class="container case">
    <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to home</a>

    <article class="tile case-head reveal">
      <p class="tile-label">/case-study</p>
      <h1 class="case-title">Witchly</h1>
      <p class="case-deck">
        Scaling a game-hosting ISP from zero to 10,000+ users on Hetzner bare-metal —
        solo, with zero external funding.
      </p>
      <div class="case-meta">
        <span>2021 — Present</span>
        <span class="dot">·</span>
        <span>Founder & sole operator</span>
        <span class="dot">·</span>
        <a href="https://witchly.host" target="_blank" rel="noopener">witchly.host →</a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <section class="bento case-stats reveal" aria-label="Witchly stats">
      <div class="tile stat-tile span-3 row-1">
        <p class="tile-label">/users</p>
        <span class="case-stat-value">10,000+</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tile stat-tile span-3 row-1">
        <p class="tile-label">/uptime</p>
        <span class="case-stat-value good">99.9%</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tile stat-tile span-3 row-1">
        <p class="tile-label">/funding</p>
        <span class="case-stat-value">$0</span>
      </div>
      <div class="tile stat-tile span-3 row-1">
        <p class="tile-label">/email</p>
        <span class="case-stat-value">10/10</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <article class="tile case-intro reveal">
      <p>
        Witchly started in 2021 as a single Hetzner box hosting Minecraft servers for friends.
        Five years later it's a multi-node game-hosting ISP serving thousands of paying users —
        and I still run all of it: infrastructure, ops, support, billing, and the customer-facing
        site.
      </p>
      <p>
        The case study PDF below covers how that happened. It walks through architecture choices,
        scaling milestones, security incidents (DDoS storms, SSH brute-force), and the slow grind
        of getting transactional email to a 10/10 deliverability score.
        <strong>The PDF renders inline below; you can also <a href="/Case-Study/Witchly-scaling.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">download it directly</a>.</strong>
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="tile case-pdf reveal" aria-label="Witchly case study PDF">
      <object
        data="/Case-Study/Witchly-scaling.pdf"
        type="application/pdf"
        class="pdf-frame"
        aria-label="Witchly case study"
      >
        <div class="pdf-fallback">
          <p>
            Your browser can't display the PDF inline.
            <a href="/Case-Study/Witchly-scaling.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              Download the case study →
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </object>
    </article>

    <section class="case-stack-wrap reveal">
      <h2 class="section-h">Stack at a glance</h2>
      <div class="bento stack-grid">
        <div class="tile stack-item span-4 row-1">
          <p class="stack-h">Infrastructure</p>
          <p class="stack-b">Hetzner bare-metal Ubuntu, kernel-tuned for high concurrency.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tile stack-item span-4 row-1">
          <p class="stack-h">Container orchestration</p>
          <p class="stack-b">Docker + Pterodactyl, cgroup-isolated tenant environments.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tile stack-item span-4 row-1">
          <p class="stack-h">Edge & DNS</p>
          <p class="stack-b">Cloudflare in front of Nginx reverse proxies; SSL via Let's Encrypt.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tile stack-item span-4 row-1">
          <p class="stack-h">Security</p>
          <p class="stack-b">UFW + Fail2Ban, hardened SSH, automated DDoS mitigation playbooks.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tile stack-item span-4 row-1">
          <p class="stack-h">Email</p>
          <p class="stack-b">Self-hosted Mailcow with full SPF / DKIM / DMARC / PTR.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="tile stack-item span-4 row-1">
          <p class="stack-h">Data</p>
          <p class="stack-b">MariaDB with replication, scheduled backups to off-site storage.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <article class="tile case-cta reveal">
      <h2>Want to chat about scaling, hosting, or infra security?</h2>
      <div class="case-cta-row">
        <a href="/#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get in touch</a>
        <a href="/Case-Study/Witchly-scaling.pdf" class="btn btn-outline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          Download PDF
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .case {
    padding-top: 100px;
    padding-bottom: 40px;
    max-width: 1100px;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--muted-3);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    transition: color 0.2s var(--ease);
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--primary-soft);
  }

  .case-head {
    padding: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.10), transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 80% 80%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.08), transparent 50%),
      var(--tile-bg);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .case-title {
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -2px;
    line-height: 1;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff 0%, var(--accent) 100%);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    margin: 8px 0 14px;
  }

  .case-deck {
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.25rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .case-meta {
    color: var(--muted-3);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .case-meta .dot {
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  .case-meta a {
    color: var(--primary-soft);
    transition: color 0.2s var(--ease);
  }

  .case-meta a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .case-stats {
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .case-stats .stat-tile {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .case-stat-value {
    display: block;
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.8vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-soft), var(--accent));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    line-height: 1;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  .case-stat-value.good {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--good-soft), var(--good));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }

  .case-intro {
    padding: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    max-width: none;
  }

  .case-intro p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .case-intro p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .case-intro strong {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .case-intro a {
    color: var(--primary-soft);
    border-bottom: 1px dashed currentColor;
  }

  .case-intro a:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .case-pdf {
    padding: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .pdf-frame {
    width: 100%;
    height: 80vh;
    min-height: 560px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: #1a1a22;
    display: block;
  }

  .pdf-fallback {
    padding: 60px 30px;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .pdf-fallback a {
    color: var(--primary-soft);
  }

  .case-stack-wrap {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .section-h {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-strong);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  .stack-h {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--accent);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .stack-b {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .case-cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
    background:
      linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.08), rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.06)),
      var(--tile-bg);
  }

  .case-cta h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.2vw, 1.6rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-strong);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  .case-cta-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
</style>
